1
00:00:01,750 --> 00:00:03,920
[DARKNESS] This is a wedding
between two nobles.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,800
[DARKNESS]
You will be executed!

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,970
This is foolish!

4
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,430
You are so stupid to think--

5
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:11,800
I will not let
a dumbass call me stupid!

6
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:13,970
[KAZUMA]
What the hell is with you

7
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,680
trying to shoulder
all my debt like this?

8
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:17,730
[KAZUMA] It's like you wanna be
my wife or somethin'!

9
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,390
I thought I told you before!

10
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,230
If ya like me,
admit it already!

11
00:00:21,770 --> 00:00:23,440
There is nothing
for me to admit!

12
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:24,650
You,

13
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,780
you are such a idiot!

14
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:29,530
[ALDARP]
You miserable peasant.

15
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:32,700
Lalatina owes me
a total of two billion eris!

16
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:34,200
Do you know what that means?

17
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:35,410
If you want her back,

18
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:37,330
that's how much
I expect you to pay.

19
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,410
[ALDARP] As if
such an outrageous sum

20
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,880
were even possible!

21
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:43,000
You just said it,
so no take backs!

22
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:44,960
[ALDARP]
What's all this about?

23
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:48,680
Here's the two billion
Darkness borrowed,

24
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:51,130
so now that you've got it,

25
00:00:51,550 --> 00:00:52,680
we're outta here!

26
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:53,810
[shatters]

27
00:00:53,930 --> 00:00:55,600
[coins clatters]

28
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:58,270
[all gasp]

29
00:00:58,730 --> 00:01:01,400
[crowd clamoring]

30
00:01:01,730 --> 00:01:03,940
Is that two billion eris?

31
00:01:04,150 --> 00:01:06,400
All of those coins
belong to me!

32
00:01:06,780 --> 00:01:08,570
Hey, don't you touch that!

33
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:10,740
[ALDARP]
No, stop! It's mine, dammit!

34
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:12,700
[ALDARP] Get away from there!
Each one of you! I'm serious!

35
00:01:12,870 --> 00:01:13,910
What is this?

36
00:01:14,030 --> 00:01:15,450
Where did it all come from?

37
00:01:16,330 --> 00:01:17,330
[KAZUMA]
I sold out.

38
00:01:17,410 --> 00:01:18,410
[gasps]

39
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:20,210
[KAZUMA]
Every single idea I had left,

40
00:01:20,290 --> 00:01:21,790
and the rights to them too.

41
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:23,500
Also,

42
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:26,340
I added everything we've earned
from going on our quests

43
00:01:26,590 --> 00:01:28,760
and it came out
to exactly two billion.

44
00:01:29,010 --> 00:01:30,090
Seriously?

45
00:01:31,010 --> 00:01:32,050
How could you?

46
00:01:32,260 --> 00:01:34,050
You have got to be the most--

47
00:01:34,180 --> 00:01:36,680
You don't get to say
"no" anymore! Understand?

48
00:01:36,810 --> 00:01:37,770
[Kazuma grunts]

49
00:01:37,970 --> 00:01:38,980
Listen up!

50
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:41,180
I'm gettin' my money's worth
outta you!

51
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:44,100
And you'll be earning back
every last coin with your body,

52
00:01:44,190 --> 00:01:45,730
so you better brace yourself!

53
00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:48,820
Do you get what I'm saying',
you degenerate Crusader?

54
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:51,030
Because if you do,
I wanna hear it!

55
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:53,740
[DARKNESS]
Yes!

56
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:56,160
[crying]

57
00:01:56,490 --> 00:01:57,490
[gasps]

58
00:01:57,580 --> 00:01:58,580
[thuds]

59
00:02:00,290 --> 00:02:02,000
[KAZUMA] It looks like
I definitely landed

60
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:04,250
a critical hit
against her masochism.

61
00:02:04,370 --> 00:02:05,380
[KAZUMA]
Man, does she have

62
00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:07,420
the worst timing
with this stuff or what?

63
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,010
Get your hands off my...

64
00:02:10,670 --> 00:02:11,670
[Kazuma running]

65
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:13,630
[Darkness panting]

66
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:16,050
You demanded
that I pay you with my body.

67
00:02:16,350 --> 00:02:18,430
Now you carry me
like I'm your bride.

68
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:20,470
Hey do you mind?
Watch it with the drool!

69
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:22,310
[AQUA]
It's "Kazuma the Dirtbag."

70
00:02:22,430 --> 00:02:23,020
Dirtbag?

71
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:24,640
[AQUA] He only returned
the money used to pay off

72
00:02:24,730 --> 00:02:25,730
his own debt

73
00:02:25,810 --> 00:02:27,980
but he's making it seem like
he bought Darkness.

74
00:02:28,070 --> 00:02:29,150
What are you talking about?

75
00:02:29,230 --> 00:02:31,440
I just meant she'd earn it
back as an adventurer!

76
00:02:31,570 --> 00:02:33,450
[soldiers clamoring]

77
00:02:34,950 --> 00:02:36,280
- Hey, Kazuma?
- Yo!

78
00:02:36,620 --> 00:02:38,120
Run with your own legs, now!

79
00:02:38,410 --> 00:02:40,240
[KAZUMA] All that muscle
is starting to get

80
00:02:40,330 --> 00:02:41,750
pretty heavy, dammit!

81
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,660
I am not heavy!

82
00:02:44,790 --> 00:02:45,790
[ALL]
Huh?

83
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:47,750
[DARKNESS]
I have had enough of this!

84
00:02:49,420 --> 00:02:50,800
Lapdogs of the lord!

85
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:53,670
Time to step aside
and if you do not comply.

86
00:02:54,260 --> 00:02:55,840
You are dead meat!

87
00:02:55,930 --> 00:02:56,970
Come back!

88
00:02:57,050 --> 00:02:59,010
You think rushing them
is gonna do anything?

89
00:02:59,100 --> 00:03:01,430
Aqua I could really
use some buffs now!

90
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,140
Yeah, I've got you covered!

91
00:03:03,310 --> 00:03:05,690
Are you ready for some
versatile entertainment?

92
00:03:06,230 --> 00:03:08,730
[GUARD 1] Ow, ow, ow, ow,
ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow.

93
00:03:10,230 --> 00:03:11,400
[ALDARP]
That's enough, men!

94
00:03:11,650 --> 00:03:12,820
[ALDARP]
Never mind her!

95
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:15,200
[ALDARP] Get over here
and help me gather up my money!

96
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:17,910
[ALL] Sir!
Right away, Sir!

97
00:03:20,410 --> 00:03:21,450
- Well played.
- Well played.

98
00:03:21,870 --> 00:03:23,750
[GUARDS]
Lord Aldarp!

99
00:03:23,830 --> 00:03:25,580
What do you people think
you're doing?

100
00:03:26,210 --> 00:03:28,710
Turn around
and catch Lalatina, right now!

101
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:31,500
[KAZUMA]
All right!

102
00:03:31,670 --> 00:03:32,880
We're almost clear!

103
00:03:33,010 --> 00:03:34,010
[all gasp]

104
00:03:34,090 --> 00:03:35,380
[Large Guard screams]

105
00:03:35,470 --> 00:03:36,510
[thuds]

106
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:39,180
[rumbling]

107
00:03:40,470 --> 00:03:43,220
[LARGE GUARD] You stop.
I no let escape.

108
00:03:43,350 --> 00:03:44,850
[ALL]
So huge!

109
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,440
[guards clamoring]

110
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:50,230
Hey, they've got us trapped
we're surrounded!

111
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:53,280
[AQUA] So, what now?
What are we gonna do?

112
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:56,820
[YUNYUN]
Light of Saber!

113
00:03:56,900 --> 00:03:59,910
[large guard groaning]

114
00:04:01,620 --> 00:04:03,330
[Kazuma straining]

115
00:04:03,870 --> 00:04:04,870
Huh?

116
00:04:05,870 --> 00:04:07,120
[YUNYUN]
Megumin, I did it!

117
00:04:07,330 --> 00:04:08,460
[YUNYUN]
I actually did it!

118
00:04:08,670 --> 00:04:10,420
[YUNYUN]
I-If my best friend asks me to

119
00:04:10,580 --> 00:04:12,340
I-I'm even willing
to break the law

120
00:04:12,420 --> 00:04:13,840
if that's what's necessary!

121
00:04:14,170 --> 00:04:15,260
[MEGUMIN]
Yes, you are.

122
00:04:15,460 --> 00:04:17,010
[MEGUMIN]
As expected of my best friend.

123
00:04:17,090 --> 00:04:18,090
Huh?

124
00:04:18,630 --> 00:04:21,050
The wizard you deem
wicked has arrived.

125
00:04:21,850 --> 00:04:23,310
And based on instinct

126
00:04:23,970 --> 00:04:26,270
I know I must now
kidnap the bride!

127
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,850
[electrifying]

128
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:29,730
[KAZUMA]
She's about to set off

129
00:04:29,810 --> 00:04:32,150
Explosion magic
in the middle of town!

130
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:35,230
I know her!
She's a stark raving lunatic!

131
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,360
[NOBLE 1]
What's that light?

132
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:38,240
[NOBLE 1] Could it be
her Explosion magic?

133
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:39,780
Hey Megumin!

134
00:04:39,950 --> 00:04:41,200
Do you see down there?

135
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:43,030
I think Kazuma already...

136
00:04:43,870 --> 00:04:44,910
[gasps]

137
00:04:45,830 --> 00:04:46,830
[chuckles softly]

138
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,750
It's obvious to me
she's bluffing!

139
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:52,290
That girl would never use
such a thing here!

140
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:54,420
I want them all
restrained at once!

141
00:04:54,590 --> 00:04:55,590
Oh?

142
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,920
You're saying I would
think twice, is that it?

143
00:04:58,050 --> 00:04:59,130
That I would flinch
at the thought

144
00:04:59,220 --> 00:05:00,930
of using Explosion magic?

145
00:05:01,180 --> 00:05:02,970
Well, I'm afraid
you're quite mistaken!

146
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:05,640
[MEGUMIN] So consider
the challenge accepted!

147
00:05:05,810 --> 00:05:06,930
[ALL]
Huh?

148
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:08,020
Don't do it!

149
00:05:08,100 --> 00:05:09,560
No, don't!
We're all staying back!

150
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:12,650
[NOBLE 2] Lord Aldarp, please!
Stop provoking the girl!

151
00:05:12,980 --> 00:05:15,070
[KAZUMA] Just had
to steal the spotlight, huh?

152
00:05:15,610 --> 00:05:17,780
I didn't expect
you to get here first.

153
00:05:18,190 --> 00:05:19,200
[DARKNESS]
Megumin.

154
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:20,780
[DARKNESS]
And Yunyun, as well.

155
00:05:21,570 --> 00:05:22,570
Back at home...

156
00:05:23,910 --> 00:05:25,370
I will have to thank you.

157
00:05:27,330 --> 00:05:28,410
It's all right.

158
00:05:28,750 --> 00:05:31,330
Because, after all
we are friends.

159
00:05:32,670 --> 00:05:35,090
Y- You're such
a talented Crusader

160
00:05:35,380 --> 00:05:37,340
so, I couldn't lose you
without a fight.

161
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,050
[Kazuma chuckles softly]

162
00:05:40,470 --> 00:05:42,340
[ALDARP] All of you!
In the peanut gallery!

163
00:05:42,590 --> 00:05:45,800
[ALDARP] I'm referring to those
who're obviously adventurers!

164
00:05:45,890 --> 00:05:46,890
[ALL]
Huh?

165
00:05:46,970 --> 00:05:49,520
My bride has been taken
and I want her back!

166
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:51,770
For a handsome reward,
of course!

167
00:05:51,850 --> 00:05:53,230
[ALDARP]
Just name your price!

168
00:05:53,650 --> 00:05:55,360
[ALDARP]
Are you listening to me?

169
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,610
[ALDARP] Soon, your days
of living hand-to-mouth

170
00:05:57,690 --> 00:05:58,860
will be over!

171
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,240
[Kazuma gasps]

172
00:06:01,610 --> 00:06:02,780
[crackling]

173
00:06:02,950 --> 00:06:05,240
♪

174
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:08,870
[DUST]
Hey let's play some soccer!

175
00:06:10,580 --> 00:06:11,580
Let's do this!

176
00:06:12,460 --> 00:06:14,130
[SAKAMAKI]
Hey pass it here!

177
00:06:14,370 --> 00:06:16,420
Get this game started guys!

178
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:18,090
[Bikini yawning]

179
00:06:18,420 --> 00:06:20,050
[MAGE]
Going for the corner, huh?

180
00:06:22,220 --> 00:06:23,220
[blows air]

181
00:06:23,300 --> 00:06:24,800
[shook]

182
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:27,800
Ya see that?

183
00:06:27,930 --> 00:06:29,890
They're all here
to help you get outta this.

184
00:06:30,140 --> 00:06:32,180
So maybe you should flex
some of those brain muscles

185
00:06:32,270 --> 00:06:33,390
and think about what you did.

186
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:36,480
[Darkness whimpers]

187
00:06:36,690 --> 00:06:37,810
[chuckles]

188
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:40,730
[KAZUMA]
This story's pretty nice.

189
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:43,700
[TROOPS]
Lord Aldarp!

190
00:06:43,780 --> 00:06:44,950
Ah!

191
00:06:45,030 --> 00:06:46,410
You finally made it, I see!

192
00:06:46,490 --> 00:06:47,490
Aw, crap!

193
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,290
We've gotta get going!

194
00:06:49,450 --> 00:06:50,580
[MEGUMIN]
Kazuma!

195
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:56,210
[MEGUMIN] I can't.
I can't hold on much longer!

196
00:06:57,170 --> 00:06:59,170
Can I release this thing, already?

197
00:06:59,540 --> 00:07:02,340
I really need
to let it go please!

198
00:07:05,340 --> 00:07:07,510
No wait not here, Megumin!

199
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:08,890
I can't hold it!

200
00:07:08,970 --> 00:07:10,180
Hey you bet you can!

201
00:07:10,310 --> 00:07:11,850
'Cause I know
you have it in you!

202
00:07:11,930 --> 00:07:13,180
[KAZUMA]
Just hang in there, all right?

203
00:07:13,270 --> 00:07:14,480
[KAZUMA]
Don't tense up too much!

204
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,440
[KAZUMA] You've got this
and whatever you do

205
00:07:16,650 --> 00:07:17,650
don't give up!

206
00:07:17,730 --> 00:07:18,730
Here it comes!

207
00:07:18,860 --> 00:07:22,440
[MEGUMIN]
Everybody get away from me!

208
00:07:22,610 --> 00:07:25,700
[KAZUMA]
Run for it!

209
00:07:26,910 --> 00:07:30,620
[MEGUMIN]
Explosion!

210
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,660
[explosion]

211
00:07:33,620 --> 00:07:35,160
[explosions]

212
00:07:35,410 --> 00:07:37,330
[people clamoring]

213
00:07:38,170 --> 00:07:40,290
[glasses shatter]

214
00:07:40,380 --> 00:07:41,880
[wind blowing]

215
00:07:46,130 --> 00:07:48,390
[wind blowing]

216
00:07:53,020 --> 00:07:55,180
[groaning]

217
00:07:58,850 --> 00:07:59,980
[wand clatters]

218
00:08:01,820 --> 00:08:02,820
This,

219
00:08:02,980 --> 00:08:05,070
this is our chance to...

220
00:08:05,490 --> 00:08:06,780
Huh?

221
00:08:07,650 --> 00:08:08,660
Wow.

222
00:08:08,990 --> 00:08:11,200
Are you actually hiding
behind the one person

223
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:12,660
you came here
to try and rescue?

224
00:08:12,870 --> 00:08:14,410
Yeah, how awful.

225
00:08:15,370 --> 00:08:16,410
[YUNYUN]
Kazuma, that's horrible!

226
00:08:16,500 --> 00:08:17,540
[KAZUMA]
I'm Kazuma.

227
00:08:17,620 --> 00:08:18,750
[gasps]

228
00:08:19,790 --> 00:08:21,420
They're getting away!

229
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:23,960
[ALDARP] She can't use
Explosion magic again!

230
00:08:24,130 --> 00:08:25,510
[ALDARP]
Restrain them!

231
00:08:26,010 --> 00:08:28,510
Hey, Kazuma!
Kazuma! Wait up!

232
00:08:28,590 --> 00:08:29,970
[crying]

233
00:08:30,090 --> 00:08:31,220
Aqua?

234
00:08:31,300 --> 00:08:33,470
[KEITH]
The pain!

235
00:08:34,060 --> 00:08:35,930
Ugh, he knocked me right over!

236
00:08:36,020 --> 00:08:37,640
My bone!
My bone!

237
00:08:37,770 --> 00:08:40,480
Dust, I really need help!
You've gotta save me!

238
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:42,480
[crying]

239
00:08:42,900 --> 00:08:43,900
[ALL]
Huh?

240
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:46,110
Keith I'm here for you!

241
00:08:46,690 --> 00:08:48,280
Lemme take a look at this.

242
00:08:48,610 --> 00:08:49,610
His arm.

243
00:08:49,700 --> 00:08:51,370
It's a comminuted fracture.

244
00:08:51,740 --> 00:08:53,410
Enough of this farce!

245
00:08:54,530 --> 00:08:55,540
Hey you!

246
00:08:55,620 --> 00:08:57,250
You let go of me at once!

247
00:08:57,370 --> 00:08:59,210
I thought that arm
was badly broken!

248
00:08:59,330 --> 00:09:00,960
[DUST]
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

249
00:09:02,170 --> 00:09:05,210
So you think you can put
my close friend in a wheelchair

250
00:09:05,300 --> 00:09:07,920
without even offering him
a sincere apology?

251
00:09:08,420 --> 00:09:10,720
You must think
you're hot stuff, huh?

252
00:09:11,180 --> 00:09:12,840
[GUARD 1]
I thought he has a broken arm!

253
00:09:12,970 --> 00:09:14,800
[GUARD 1] What's all this
about a wheelchair?

254
00:09:14,970 --> 00:09:16,430
[GUARD 1]
I've had just enough of your...

255
00:09:17,430 --> 00:09:18,680
Ow!

256
00:09:19,230 --> 00:09:21,100
This bastard's
getting violent now!

257
00:09:21,190 --> 00:09:22,190
You hear that?

258
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:23,900
The authorities
are going rogue!

259
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:26,190
They can't screw
with adventurers like this!

260
00:09:26,820 --> 00:09:28,440
[ADVENTURER 1]
You won't get away with it!

261
00:09:28,780 --> 00:09:30,700
[ADVENTURER 1]
Who do you think you are?

262
00:09:32,570 --> 00:09:33,660
[thuds]

263
00:09:33,780 --> 00:09:36,660
[DUST] After everything
the last noble put me through.

264
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:39,950
[DUST] I've got a whole lot
to take out on you clowns!

265
00:09:40,460 --> 00:09:42,920
[KAZUMA] I guess I owe 'em
another round of drinks.

266
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,750
My beautiful bride!
Come back!

267
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:49,380
[ALDARP] Don't go!
Don't go, Lalatina!

268
00:09:50,170 --> 00:09:51,220
[footsteps approaching]

269
00:09:51,300 --> 00:09:52,300
Huh?

270
00:09:52,430 --> 00:09:53,680
Wait you again?

271
00:09:53,970 --> 00:09:55,220
[knocking on door]

272
00:09:55,470 --> 00:09:56,510
[DARKNESS]
I'm coming in.

273
00:09:56,890 --> 00:09:57,890
[door opens]

274
00:09:58,890 --> 00:09:59,890
[all gasp]

275
00:09:59,970 --> 00:10:02,310
[weak breaths]

276
00:10:03,850 --> 00:10:04,850
[gasps]

277
00:10:06,570 --> 00:10:08,820
[footsteps approaching]

278
00:10:08,900 --> 00:10:10,900
[weak breaths]

279
00:10:11,610 --> 00:10:13,610
You look quite lovely.

280
00:10:13,990 --> 00:10:16,870
[IGNIS] And so much
like your dear mother.

281
00:10:17,660 --> 00:10:19,080
I must apologize.

282
00:10:20,250 --> 00:10:21,960
This wedding was all my idea

283
00:10:22,910 --> 00:10:25,500
and it fell apart
in the worst possible way.

284
00:10:26,630 --> 00:10:28,380
Did it, now?

285
00:10:28,670 --> 00:10:29,710
[chuckles softly]

286
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:34,050
[IGNIS]
Kazuma.

287
00:10:35,430 --> 00:10:38,140
I think I need to go
and get some fresh air.

288
00:10:39,350 --> 00:10:40,350
[Kazuma sighs]

289
00:10:43,020 --> 00:10:44,940
[IGNIS]
Thank you so much, my boy.

290
00:10:45,100 --> 00:10:46,310
[IGNIS]
I'm grateful.

291
00:10:47,310 --> 00:10:48,480
It was no big deal.

292
00:10:48,570 --> 00:10:50,440
All I did was just pay back
what I owed her.

293
00:10:52,030 --> 00:10:53,110
Kazuma.

294
00:10:53,490 --> 00:10:56,110
I was wondering
if you would take my daughter

295
00:10:56,780 --> 00:10:57,990
won't you please.

296
00:10:58,070 --> 00:10:59,080
[gasps]

297
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,240
Thanks, but no thanks.

298
00:11:00,330 --> 00:11:01,660
Couldn't take the punishment.

299
00:11:01,790 --> 00:11:02,950
[Darkness screams]

300
00:11:03,210 --> 00:11:04,580
You are unbelievable!

301
00:11:04,710 --> 00:11:06,500
How could you
possibly say that?

302
00:11:06,670 --> 00:11:08,920
[Darkness whimpering]

303
00:11:09,630 --> 00:11:11,710
[KAZUMA] This guy's
one of the kingdom's pillars.

304
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,550
[KAZUMA] So,
he can see right through me.

305
00:11:15,130 --> 00:11:16,300
[KAZUMA]
I understand.

306
00:11:16,680 --> 00:11:18,140
[KAZUMA]
And I'll take good care of her.

307
00:11:20,100 --> 00:11:21,310
[sighs]

308
00:11:23,390 --> 00:11:24,810
Lalatina,

309
00:11:25,350 --> 00:11:28,150
do you enjoy
the life you have now?

310
00:11:29,060 --> 00:11:30,060
Oh, yes.

311
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:31,980
For the sake of my friends,

312
00:11:32,280 --> 00:11:34,690
I'm fully willing
to abandon everything else.

313
00:11:35,950 --> 00:11:37,030
I see.

314
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:40,330
♪

315
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:48,460
[sobbing]

316
00:11:50,290 --> 00:11:51,420
Thank you, Father.

317
00:11:51,670 --> 00:11:52,880
All my life

318
00:11:53,710 --> 00:11:55,340
you wanted the best for me,

319
00:11:56,510 --> 00:11:57,640
and I love you.

320
00:11:59,510 --> 00:12:01,930
When you start to feel better
maybe,

321
00:12:02,930 --> 00:12:05,390
maybe we can talk
until I fall fast asleep.

322
00:12:06,310 --> 00:12:08,650
About Mother,
the way we used to.

323
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,560
[chuckles]

324
00:12:11,060 --> 00:12:14,490
It feels like
you're a child again, Lalatina.

325
00:12:15,150 --> 00:12:16,530
Sweet girl.

326
00:12:16,900 --> 00:12:20,320
Please stay here.

327
00:12:21,410 --> 00:12:22,410
[DARKNESS]
Father!

328
00:12:23,990 --> 00:12:25,330
[KAZUMA]
This is pretty rough.

329
00:12:25,950 --> 00:12:27,620
[KAZUMA]
He doesn't have much longer.

330
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:29,080
[AQUA]
All right!

331
00:12:29,670 --> 00:12:31,590
Time for Sacred Break Spell!

332
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,500
[Ignis groaning]

333
00:12:33,590 --> 00:12:35,300
[DARKNESS] Oh, no!
Father!

334
00:12:35,420 --> 00:12:37,680
[Darkness screaming]

335
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:39,510
[Ignis screaming]

336
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:42,220
Your dad was cursed!

337
00:12:42,300 --> 00:12:44,970
Mister you've just
gotta trust me, it was nasty!

338
00:12:45,060 --> 00:12:46,060
But I used my power

339
00:12:46,140 --> 00:12:47,690
and cleaned it all up
super nice!

340
00:12:47,810 --> 00:12:48,940
[KAZUMA]
Huh?

341
00:12:54,690 --> 00:12:56,230
[Darkness whimpers]

342
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,110
Everything should be okay!

343
00:12:58,360 --> 00:13:00,070
Pretty awesome,
right, Darkness?

344
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:02,450
And Mister
you can talk about her mom

345
00:13:02,530 --> 00:13:04,030
as long as she wants now!

346
00:13:06,370 --> 00:13:08,870
[KAZUMA]
This story's pretty nice.

347
00:13:10,620 --> 00:13:12,580
[ALDARP]
How dare you humiliate me!

348
00:13:12,830 --> 00:13:15,250
You are such a worthless
waste of a demon!

349
00:13:15,460 --> 00:13:17,800
That's all you can "adjust?"

350
00:13:17,920 --> 00:13:19,840
[grunting]

351
00:13:19,970 --> 00:13:21,800
[MAXWELL]
By some unknown means,

352
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:25,430
the curse on Sir Dustiness
seems to have been broken.

353
00:13:25,760 --> 00:13:27,140
The curse is broken?

354
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:29,180
Unbelievable

355
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:31,020
and at this rate.

356
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:32,730
Look, Maxwell!

357
00:13:32,810 --> 00:13:35,650
You need to warp this story
to suit my needs yet again,

358
00:13:35,730 --> 00:13:36,860
you understand?

359
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:39,320
But I can't, Aldarp.

360
00:13:39,450 --> 00:13:40,490
Oh, really?

361
00:13:41,030 --> 00:13:42,660
You lowlife scoundrel.

362
00:13:42,990 --> 00:13:44,910
[ALDARP] You were summoned
with this Divine Treasure.

363
00:13:44,990 --> 00:13:46,240
[ALDARP]
Or did you forget?

364
00:13:46,330 --> 00:13:47,330
Do it!

365
00:13:47,410 --> 00:13:49,500
You aren't allowed
to refuse what I say!

366
00:13:49,660 --> 00:13:50,750
I know.

367
00:13:50,830 --> 00:13:52,080
But the powerful light

368
00:13:52,170 --> 00:13:54,250
that broke the curse
is interfering.

369
00:13:54,460 --> 00:13:55,590
[MAXWELL]
So, I can't.

370
00:13:55,710 --> 00:13:58,300
You good-for-nothing miscreant!

371
00:13:58,380 --> 00:13:59,920
[ALDARP] Enough of this!
Enough of you!

372
00:14:00,010 --> 00:14:01,590
[ALDARP]
Here is your final order!

373
00:14:01,760 --> 00:14:04,600
[ALDARP] You must bring
Lalatina to me right now!

374
00:14:04,680 --> 00:14:07,970
[ALDARP] When you do,
I'll gladly pay your price!

375
00:14:08,850 --> 00:14:10,810
You'll pay my price?

376
00:14:11,060 --> 00:14:12,270
That's what I said!

377
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:14,020
Now stop wasting time or I--

378
00:14:14,100 --> 00:14:15,100
[DARKNESS]
Your Lordship?

379
00:14:15,610 --> 00:14:17,070
[DARKNESS]
I have come to apologize.

380
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:18,690
[gasps]

381
00:14:18,940 --> 00:14:21,070
This is excellent work,
Maxwell!

382
00:14:21,190 --> 00:14:23,150
You have most certainly
earned your payment!

383
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:25,360
And you're released
from our contract!

384
00:14:25,620 --> 00:14:26,620
[ALDARP]
Oh, Lalatina! Lalatina!

385
00:14:26,700 --> 00:14:28,410
[MAXWELL]
The contract.

386
00:14:28,990 --> 00:14:30,410
[door opens]

387
00:14:31,410 --> 00:14:33,540
Oh.

388
00:14:34,290 --> 00:14:35,290
Your Lordship.

389
00:14:35,540 --> 00:14:38,210
Please, sir,
keep my friend safe.

390
00:14:38,420 --> 00:14:40,760
- In exchange--
- I can have you all to myself!

391
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:42,920
You belong to me now!

392
00:14:43,010 --> 00:14:45,050
[groans]

393
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:47,760
[Aldarp screams]

394
00:14:49,470 --> 00:14:51,480
[VANIR] Did you really think
it was Lalatina?

395
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:52,430
[VANIR]
Well, that's too bad!

396
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:54,310
[VANIR] Because it was
none other than I!

397
00:14:55,310 --> 00:14:58,820
[VANIR] Oh my. Such a massive
swell of negative emotion!

398
00:14:59,150 --> 00:15:01,030
[VANIR]
How very flavorful.

399
00:15:01,900 --> 00:15:04,070
This unmistakable
feeling of dread.

400
00:15:04,150 --> 00:15:05,910
You must be the same as Max!

401
00:15:06,570 --> 00:15:08,410
[MAXWELL] I'm sorry
but have we met before?

402
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:09,700
[VANIR]
I must've made

403
00:15:09,790 --> 00:15:12,750
this introduction
thousands of times by now

404
00:15:12,830 --> 00:15:14,960
but, I suppose
I can do it for you again.

405
00:15:15,620 --> 00:15:18,420
[VANIR] Nice to meet you,
Maxwell the Warper of Truth.

406
00:15:18,670 --> 00:15:19,880
[VANIR]
I'm Vanir.

407
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:22,260
[VANIR] The all-seeing.
A shrewd demon.

408
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:23,840
Vanir, huh?

409
00:15:24,260 --> 00:15:25,470
Ah, yes!

410
00:15:25,630 --> 00:15:26,680
I don't know why,

411
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:28,760
but that sounds
quite familiar to me.

412
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:31,010
[Vanir]
Let's go, Maxwell.

413
00:15:31,350 --> 00:15:33,100
It's time you returned
home to hell.

414
00:15:33,270 --> 00:15:35,560
You can't take him, yet!
He's my servant!

415
00:15:36,230 --> 00:15:37,440
[VANIR]
Oh really?

416
00:15:37,860 --> 00:15:39,820
[VANIR] You would dare
refer to one of my peers

417
00:15:39,900 --> 00:15:43,360
and a fellow duke of Hell
as merely your "servant"?

418
00:15:44,740 --> 00:15:46,070
A-A duke?

419
00:15:46,450 --> 00:15:48,740
[VANIR] You should
consider yourself rather lucky.

420
00:15:49,450 --> 00:15:51,080
[VANIR] If you'd
summoned any other demon,

421
00:15:51,160 --> 00:15:53,200
you would've been
torn limb from limb.

422
00:15:54,160 --> 00:15:56,080
[MAXWELL] Vanir!
Vanir!

423
00:15:57,210 --> 00:16:00,210
[VANIR] You rose to your
station in life thanks to him.

424
00:16:00,750 --> 00:16:02,090
[VANIR]
So, be grateful.

425
00:16:04,170 --> 00:16:04,960
[VANIR]
And, as promised,

426
00:16:05,050 --> 00:16:06,880
you will kindly pay him
what's owed.

427
00:16:07,130 --> 00:16:08,840
[VANIR]
The contract's over, as well.

428
00:16:10,970 --> 00:16:12,010
[VANIR]
You see.

429
00:16:12,100 --> 00:16:14,730
I'm afraid the real issue,
as far as I'm concerned,

430
00:16:14,810 --> 00:16:16,180
was the contract itself.

431
00:16:16,310 --> 00:16:18,020
[Aldarp whimpers]

432
00:16:18,190 --> 00:16:19,440
[Vanir]
I have to say,

433
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:22,150
you forced me
into playing a roundabout hand.

434
00:16:22,270 --> 00:16:23,320
Wait a minute.

435
00:16:23,530 --> 00:16:26,110
[VANIR] It is exactly
as you're imagining!

436
00:16:26,190 --> 00:16:27,740
[VANIR] For I used
the truth behind the debt

437
00:16:27,820 --> 00:16:29,780
as a pretense to inform the boy

438
00:16:30,070 --> 00:16:32,780
and he became aware
of you and your schemes!

439
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:35,450
[VANIR]
Very good!

440
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:38,120
[VANIR] Your dark emotions
are magnificent!

441
00:16:38,250 --> 00:16:40,330
[VANIR]
Sublimely flavorful!

442
00:16:40,460 --> 00:16:41,630
This is madness!

443
00:16:41,710 --> 00:16:43,840
What are you yapping about now?

444
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:45,500
[laughing]

445
00:16:47,970 --> 00:16:50,930
[VANIR] All right, then.
I do believe we're done here.

446
00:16:51,510 --> 00:16:53,010
[VANIR] I shall return
my comrade

447
00:16:53,350 --> 00:16:55,260
then I'll go back
to working diligently

448
00:16:55,350 --> 00:16:57,390
for that dimwitted entrepreneur.

449
00:16:57,940 --> 00:16:59,060
[grins]

450
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:01,270
[MAXWELL]
Vanir, Vanir!

451
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:04,480
[MAXWELL] I need to take
my payment from Aldarp

452
00:17:04,570 --> 00:17:06,190
before going back home.

453
00:17:06,320 --> 00:17:07,690
Fine very well, then!

454
00:17:07,780 --> 00:17:10,200
I'll pay your price,
now just get out of here and...

455
00:17:10,280 --> 00:17:11,280
Oh.

456
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:13,410
[Aldarp screaming in pain]

457
00:17:13,490 --> 00:17:15,120
[ALDARP]
Ow It hurts!

458
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:19,250
Yes, Aldarp!
Yes, Aldarp!

459
00:17:19,540 --> 00:17:21,670
[MAXWELL]
Wonderful screams, Aldarp!

460
00:17:22,170 --> 00:17:23,250
[VANIR] The price asked of you

461
00:17:23,330 --> 00:17:24,630
will be the negative emotions

462
00:17:24,710 --> 00:17:27,130
that suit Maxwell's
distinctive tastes.

463
00:17:27,840 --> 00:17:30,590
[VANIR] Of course,
with your remaining lifespan,

464
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:32,010
I doubt you'll survive.

465
00:17:32,090 --> 00:17:33,800
[Aldarp crying]
[ALDARP] In that case...

466
00:17:33,890 --> 00:17:36,850
[VANIR] You'd have someone else
from your family pay, I suppose?

467
00:17:37,310 --> 00:17:39,350
[VANIR] Unfortunately,
that grand responsibility

468
00:17:39,430 --> 00:17:41,100
is the contractor's alone.

469
00:17:41,190 --> 00:17:42,350
[breathing shakily]

470
00:17:42,980 --> 00:17:44,110
[VANIR]
So "no."

471
00:17:44,190 --> 00:17:46,520
[VANIR] And though I'm sure
this feast is quite robust

472
00:17:46,820 --> 00:17:50,030
anguish and despair have never
suited my discerning palette.

473
00:17:50,490 --> 00:17:51,280
[Aldarp breathing] [VANIR] But
it's a special flavor

474
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:54,990
that Maxwell has grown
rather fond of.

475
00:17:56,410 --> 00:17:58,160
[birds chirping]

476
00:17:58,330 --> 00:18:00,080
Nobody can find Lord Aldarp?

477
00:18:00,620 --> 00:18:01,750
Seems his long list

478
00:18:01,830 --> 00:18:03,370
of wrongdoings
has come to light.

479
00:18:03,710 --> 00:18:05,580
He sent the body-swapping
Divine Treasure

480
00:18:05,710 --> 00:18:08,050
to princess Iris
as one example.

481
00:18:08,500 --> 00:18:09,720
[DARKNESS]
And I hear he ran off

482
00:18:09,800 --> 00:18:12,050
because he could no longer
conceal the truth.

483
00:18:12,380 --> 00:18:13,550
No kidding.

484
00:18:15,010 --> 00:18:16,930
Now, there is no need
to leave town.

485
00:18:17,180 --> 00:18:18,810
[all sigh]

486
00:18:19,180 --> 00:18:21,270
See everything turned out fine.

487
00:18:21,520 --> 00:18:22,850
Yeah whatever.

488
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:25,400
Man, I'm tired from
spending' all night packing.

489
00:18:25,810 --> 00:18:27,520
[MEGUMIN]
Well I suggest taking a nap

490
00:18:27,610 --> 00:18:28,690
until later this evening

491
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:30,690
and then we can
have dinner at the guild.

492
00:18:30,860 --> 00:18:31,860
Huh?

493
00:18:31,950 --> 00:18:32,950
[KAZUMA]
What's up?

494
00:18:33,070 --> 00:18:34,070
[MEGUMIN]
Are you okay?

495
00:18:34,410 --> 00:18:36,830
[AQUA] Oh I guess you weren't
there for that, Megumin!

496
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,160
Ya see.

497
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:40,700
Kazuma literally
bought Darkness outright!

498
00:18:40,830 --> 00:18:43,000
So, she's probably
too scared to come inside.

499
00:18:43,120 --> 00:18:45,120
Whoa, I wouldn't
put it like that!

500
00:18:45,210 --> 00:18:46,460
She's wrong, Megumin!

501
00:18:46,540 --> 00:18:49,090
I mean, it's kinda true,
but that wasn't my intent!

502
00:18:49,170 --> 00:18:51,590
[DARKNESS] I am so sorry
for how selfish I have been.

503
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:52,720
[ALL]
Huh?

504
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:55,890
And it was incredibly
foolish of me.

505
00:18:57,300 --> 00:18:58,390
[gasps]

506
00:18:59,510 --> 00:19:01,430
That's okay!
I don't mind one bit!

507
00:19:01,560 --> 00:19:03,890
Though Kazuma ended up
footing quite a large bill,

508
00:19:04,020 --> 00:19:05,730
I say, "all's well
that ends well!"

509
00:19:05,810 --> 00:19:06,900
She's right!

510
00:19:07,060 --> 00:19:08,560
Plus, we managed
to catch the curse

511
00:19:08,650 --> 00:19:10,070
that was making
your father sick!

512
00:19:10,690 --> 00:19:12,030
[all chuckle]

513
00:19:13,900 --> 00:19:15,070
Most likely

514
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:18,160
all the money will be recovered
from Aldarp's seized assets.

515
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:19,700
But, still.

516
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:21,120
Huh?

517
00:19:21,450 --> 00:19:22,580
[DARKNESS]
The intellectual rights

518
00:19:22,660 --> 00:19:23,960
that you had to sell off.

519
00:19:24,620 --> 00:19:26,000
[DARKNESS]
Those are gone, Kazuma.

520
00:19:27,750 --> 00:19:29,250
[KAZUMA]
That's the problem?

521
00:19:29,340 --> 00:19:30,710
Look, it's okay.

522
00:19:31,340 --> 00:19:33,630
Maybe I'll open up a cart
and start cooking foh.

523
00:19:34,260 --> 00:19:36,510
Hang on, I get my money back?

524
00:19:36,630 --> 00:19:37,640
Yeah,

525
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:39,810
the two billion eris
you handed over

526
00:19:40,140 --> 00:19:41,350
and any damages.

527
00:19:42,390 --> 00:19:44,390
Two freaking billion?

528
00:19:46,940 --> 00:19:49,230
There's something so special
about you, Kazuma!

529
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:51,690
Yeah,
it's that je ne sais quoi!

530
00:19:52,030 --> 00:19:53,740
So, I was hoping to get

531
00:19:53,820 --> 00:19:55,610
my little Emperor Zel
a fancy crib.

532
00:19:55,690 --> 00:19:56,950
That Kazuma!

533
00:19:57,030 --> 00:19:58,410
I agree, he's quite something!

534
00:19:58,490 --> 00:20:01,200
By the way, I was hoping
I could get a new robe soon.

535
00:20:01,330 --> 00:20:03,240
You're just a pair
of gold diggers!

536
00:20:03,330 --> 00:20:04,410
But me,

537
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:07,170
my ass is gonna stay
at the inn for about a week!

538
00:20:08,210 --> 00:20:09,210
[KAZUMA]
What's up?

539
00:20:09,290 --> 00:20:10,630
[KAZUMA] We already said
we were good.

540
00:20:12,340 --> 00:20:13,460
It is just

541
00:20:14,050 --> 00:20:16,050
about the letter
I wrote the three of you.

542
00:20:18,050 --> 00:20:19,260
[KAZUMA]
I get it.

543
00:20:19,340 --> 00:20:21,390
[KAZUMA] To her,
it means she left our group.

544
00:20:23,890 --> 00:20:25,520
[chuckles] Hey, is that all
you're worried about because I--

545
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:27,190
Are you kidding?
Don't be ridiculous!

546
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:30,480
As our Crusader, you are
a vital part of this line-up!

547
00:20:30,810 --> 00:20:32,480
and we wouldn't
ever let you go!

548
00:20:32,650 --> 00:20:33,690
That's right!

549
00:20:33,820 --> 00:20:35,320
What are you
even talking about?

550
00:20:35,820 --> 00:20:37,610
Are you playing
stupid or something?

551
00:20:37,700 --> 00:20:39,070
[AQUA] There's only
one place you belong

552
00:20:39,160 --> 00:20:40,410
and that's right here with us!

553
00:20:40,530 --> 00:20:41,990
[KAZUMA] Aw, man!
What the hell?

554
00:20:42,120 --> 00:20:43,580
[KAZUMA]
I was gonna say that, too!

555
00:20:43,660 --> 00:20:45,040
W- Well, I uh.

556
00:20:45,540 --> 00:20:46,540
[ALL]
Huh?

557
00:20:47,790 --> 00:20:48,830
I am a...

558
00:20:50,170 --> 00:20:51,580
I-I am a Crusader.

559
00:20:51,710 --> 00:20:54,170
Though durable, my sword
skills are rather poor.

560
00:20:54,670 --> 00:20:55,670
But...

561
00:20:56,760 --> 00:20:59,220
[DARKNESS] If you are still
interested in considering it.

562
00:21:02,930 --> 00:21:04,310
I was just wondering

563
00:21:04,970 --> 00:21:06,810
if you would let me
join you again?

564
00:21:10,560 --> 00:21:11,860
[KAZUMA]
Of course we will.

565
00:21:12,150 --> 00:21:13,190
[gasps]

566
00:21:13,560 --> 00:21:14,570
[Kazuma sighs]

567
00:21:15,030 --> 00:21:16,070
Welcome home.

568
00:21:16,150 --> 00:21:17,150
- Hm.
- Hm.

569
00:21:17,280 --> 00:21:19,990
♪ Yes we are still going up ♪

570
00:21:22,030 --> 00:21:23,280
[crying]

571
00:21:24,530 --> 00:21:25,620
[DARKNESS]
I am home!

572
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:35,420
[KAZUMA] This started
when I lived with the princess

573
00:21:35,500 --> 00:21:38,260
and turned into an existential
crisis for us all.

574
00:21:38,670 --> 00:21:39,930
[KAZUMA]
Things got pretty busy

575
00:21:40,050 --> 00:21:41,130
but before I knew it,

576
00:21:41,220 --> 00:21:42,550
every day was fun again.

577
00:21:43,550 --> 00:21:45,010
[KAZUMA]
I've got good friends.

578
00:21:45,430 --> 00:21:47,140
[KAZUMA]
Good acquaintances, too.

579
00:21:50,560 --> 00:21:52,730
[KAZUMA]
So I'm gonna live in this town.

580
00:21:52,980 --> 00:21:55,610
[KAZUMA] And when I start
itching for a little excitement

581
00:21:56,190 --> 00:21:59,150
I'll set out on an adventure
with these guys.

582
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:03,990
[KAZUMA] Right here
in this wonderful world!

583
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:06,490
[AQUA] You almost what?
[MEGUMIN] You almost what?

584
00:22:06,830 --> 00:22:08,160
What's the matter
with you, Kazuma?

585
00:22:08,250 --> 00:22:09,450
Are you an idiot or something?

586
00:22:09,580 --> 00:22:10,830
I thought the entire point

587
00:22:10,910 --> 00:22:12,830
was to bring
Darkness back home to us!

588
00:22:12,920 --> 00:22:15,790
H-He may have been in my bed,
but he only touched my stomach.

589
00:22:15,880 --> 00:22:17,300
- In your bed?
- In your bed?

590
00:22:17,380 --> 00:22:19,300
Hey wait!
I mean, yeah, okay!

591
00:22:19,380 --> 00:22:20,760
What's she's saying
is the truth

592
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:23,010
but she is the one
who put my hand there!

593
00:22:23,090 --> 00:22:24,340
- Huh?
- Huh?

594
00:22:24,430 --> 00:22:25,640
It is not like that!

595
00:22:25,800 --> 00:22:28,470
I just thought, "If I am
marrying lord Aldarp then--"

596
00:22:28,760 --> 00:22:30,100
She admitted it!

597
00:22:30,350 --> 00:22:31,560
Darkness has confessed

598
00:22:31,640 --> 00:22:33,310
to making
the first move with him!

599
00:22:33,640 --> 00:22:35,270
I'll give you two some space.

600
00:22:35,350 --> 00:22:37,150
Maybe I'll just take
Emperor Zel's egg

601
00:22:37,230 --> 00:22:38,440
out for a little sunshine.

602
00:22:38,610 --> 00:22:39,860
I guess I never realized

603
00:22:39,940 --> 00:22:41,900
what a shameless woman
you actually are!

604
00:22:41,990 --> 00:22:43,610
I feel so moronic
for worrying now!

605
00:22:43,700 --> 00:22:44,700
Hold on!

606
00:22:44,780 --> 00:22:46,490
Please you have
to wait a second, all right?

607
00:22:46,620 --> 00:22:47,700
Hey, Kazuma!

608
00:22:47,780 --> 00:22:49,410
[DARKNESS] You have
to help me explain this!

609
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:51,500
[KAZUMA]
If I have to.

610
00:22:51,910 --> 00:22:52,960
[KAZUMA]
Hey Aqua?

611
00:22:53,040 --> 00:22:54,040
[KAZUMA]
I'm curious,

612
00:22:54,120 --> 00:22:55,710
how does marriage
work in this country?

613
00:22:55,830 --> 00:22:57,540
Now where did
that question come from?

614
00:22:58,130 --> 00:22:59,750
Anyway, the first thing
you have to do

615
00:22:59,840 --> 00:23:01,090
is turn in a notice of marriage

616
00:23:01,170 --> 00:23:02,920
on the morning
of the wedding ceremony.

617
00:23:03,340 --> 00:23:04,630
And then,
it's in the afternoon,

618
00:23:04,720 --> 00:23:07,140
so, that means.

619
00:23:08,430 --> 00:23:09,600
What brought this on?

620
00:23:10,270 --> 00:23:11,980
Well, from what I've been told,

621
00:23:12,060 --> 00:23:13,060
these types of things are

622
00:23:13,140 --> 00:23:14,440
more and more
common these days.

623
00:23:14,520 --> 00:23:15,520
[Darkness gasps]

624
00:23:15,600 --> 00:23:17,690
[KAZUMA] She's a noble
who's a perverted masochist,

625
00:23:17,770 --> 00:23:20,110
and a virgin
with an ex-husband.

626
00:23:20,730 --> 00:23:22,610
If he left
in the middle of the night

627
00:23:22,690 --> 00:23:23,780
then I think that means

628
00:23:23,860 --> 00:23:25,700
you'd be considered
"abandoned," Darkness.

629
00:23:25,780 --> 00:23:26,820
[Darkness sobs]

630
00:23:27,950 --> 00:23:28,950
[Darkness sniffles]

631
00:23:29,870 --> 00:23:32,330
Hey who cares
what all the forms say?

632
00:23:33,830 --> 00:23:34,960
Divorceness.

633
00:23:36,790 --> 00:23:40,000
[DARKNESS]
Do not call me Divorceness!

